	.string "Here…\p"
	.string "It's my house! Thanks for\n"
	.string "your company.\p"
	.string "Oh, and if you're ever lost, check\n"
	.string "the MAP on your POKéGEAR!\p"
	.string "I wish you luck on your journey!$"

